# Third-party notices: voice corpus

The files under `example-text/` are excerpts from published documentation.
The excerpts are trimmed: quotations keep their original wording, but surrounding text, headings, images, and code samples are omitted.
They calibrate voice and structure; they are not content sources.
Each file's `source:` frontmatter records the exact page, title, and URL.

